### achievements-service — collection HTTP
#
# Requer a stack no ar:
#   docker compose -f infra/docker/docker-compose.yml up
#
# Todos os endpoints exigem um JWT do identity (ADR-0009). O login abaixo
# captura o token e os demais requests o reutilizam.
#
# GoLand/IntelliJ: clique no ▶ na margem. (VS Code REST Client: ver nota no fim.)
#
# Acompanhe: Grafana http://localhost:3000 (Explore -> Tempo) e o banco
# achievements em localhost:5433 (db achievements, user/pass dev/dev).

@identityHost = http://localhost:8081
@achievementsHost = http://localhost:8082
@handle = Achiever_1
@password = supersecret
# Multi-tenant por jogo (ADR-0017): o data plane envia o jogo no header
# X-Game-Id. "sandbox" = jogo default da migração (UUID nil).
@gameId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### (uma vez) Criar a conta no identity
POST {{identityHost}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "handle": "{{handle}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

### Login no identity -> captura o token
# @name login
POST {{identityHost}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "handle": "{{handle}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.token);
%}

### Catálogo de conquistas
GET {{achievementsHost}}/achievements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Enviar evento de gameplay -> desbloqueia (idempotente). Jogo no header X-Game-Id.
POST {{achievementsHost}}/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Game-Id: {{gameId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "match_won" }

### Minhas conquistas no jogo (desbloqueadas + bloqueadas)
GET {{achievementsHost}}/me/achievements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Game-Id: {{gameId}}

### Progresso parcial: cada match_won progride "ten_wins" (target 10).
### Dispare várias vezes; na 10ª, ten_wins desbloqueia. (sem X-Game-Id -> 400)
POST {{achievementsHost}}/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Game-Id: {{gameId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "match_won" }

# --- Admin (interno) por jogo — usado pelo admin-bff/session (ADR-0016/0017/0018) ---
# Control plane INTERNO: exige o header X-Internal-Key (ADR-0018), NÃO o JWT.
# NÃO expor publicamente. Jogo/jogador no path.
@internalKey = dev-internal-key

### [admin] Cadastrar uma conquista no catálogo do jogo
POST {{achievementsHost}}/admin/games/{{gameId}}/achievements
Content-Type: application/json
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}

{ "id": "first_blood", "name": "Primeiro Sangue", "description": "Primeiro abate", "eventType": "kill", "target": 1 }

### [admin] Catálogo do jogo
GET {{achievementsHost}}/admin/games/{{gameId}}/achievements
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}

### [admin] Achievements de um jogador no jogo (playerID = sub do JWT, no path)
GET {{achievementsHost}}/admin/games/{{gameId}}/players/PLAYER_ID_AQUI/achievements
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}

### [admin] Server-authoritative: reportar evento em nome do jogador (fan-out)
POST {{achievementsHost}}/admin/games/{{gameId}}/players/PLAYER_ID_AQUI/events
Content-Type: application/json
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}

{ "type": "match_won" }

# --- VS Code REST Client ---
# O bloco "> {% ... %}" é sintaxe do HTTP Client do JetBrains. No REST Client,
# remova-o e use diretamente: Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
